The D-Link DIR-878 is a Wi-Fi 5 Wave 2 router based on MediaTek MT7621A with 16 MB flash and 128 MB RAM. It has 5 Gigabit Ethernet ports and dual MediaTek MT7615N radios, capable of up to 4x4 streams on each band.

{{media:dlink:dir-878-a1.png?200|DIR-878}}

