===== Notes =====
  * This router has nearly identical internals and the same specs as the [[toh:d-link:dir-867_a1|D-Link DIR-867 A1]], [[toh:d-link:dir-882_a1|D-Link DIR-882 A1]] and Motorola MR2600 v1 apart from the lack of USB ports.
  * Due to this similarity, most software/hardware mods and even firmwares for the DIR-867, DIR-882 and MR2600 can be applied to this router without issues.
  * D-Link DIR-1760 A1, D-Link DIR-1960 A1, D-Link DIR-2640 A1 and D-Link DIR-2660 A1 also are very similar to this router, but they have more RAM (256 MB) and flash (128 MB NAND).

===== Known Issues =====
  * <del>[[https://forum.openwrt.org/t/openwrt-on-mt7621-mt7615n-devices-with-5ghz-problems/107392|MT7615N 5 GHz Problems]]</del> - fixed in OpenWrt 23.05

